module
public import Theory.SpecificGroups.Thompson.Model.GeneratorCertificates.BinaryMatrix

/-!
# Coordinates for the two induced endpoint modules of degree45

These literal binary matrices are candidate coordinates for induction of the
natural and dual three-space from the endpoint parabolic of GL4(2). The
finite identities and the eventual induced-action comparison are proved in
separate consumers. Merely storing a matrix asserts no representation or
classification property. Rows follow GAP right-action convention.

Reproduction data: Scratch/DirectBinaryThreeAmbient/FourInducedBoundary.
-/
